      "body": "> CPython versions tested on: 3.10, 3.12\n\nSadly these branches don't get bugfixes anymore: https://devguide.python.org/versions/\n\nI cannot reproduce this issue on 3.13 branch.\n\nOn the 3.14 and main branches, I'm affected by https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/138756 bug, but make completes without error if I apply my https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/138759 fix.\n\nI close the issue. Thanks for your report anyway.",
